Subject: [PATCH 081/178] Optimize powered rail propagation

- Implement iterative straight-lane search using pooled block positions

- Reduce recursive call stack and heap allocations during rail network updates

- Add config toggle optimize-powered-rails in optimizations.rails (default false for vanilla parity)

